  reuse="This follows the guard that the merged KS-1868 PRs use in this same service (`routes/issuerCerts.ts`, `routes/oauth.ts`, `routes/auth.ts`: `let reason: string; try { reason = String(err instanceof Error ? err.message : err); } catch { reason = 'unreadable thrown value'; }` before the logger call, the coercing form of PR 1924 and of operator 80 to 83's held passes); no helper exists in this file and none is added.",
